OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with some late sunshine. Skies
OL,7,Fwill cloud over after dark, with
OL,8,Fshowery outbreaks of rain arriving in
OL,9,Fthe early hours, perhaps with some
OL,10,Fheavier bursts by the morning. A
OL,11,Ffairly mild night for most.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FOutbreaks of showery rain
OL,14,Fmoving through by mid morning.
OL,15,FBecoming dry and rather warm with some
OL,16,Fbright or sunny spells developing.
OL,17,FClouding over again in the west during
OL,18,Fthe evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
