OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled at first with spells of
OL,7,Fheavy rain at times and brisk winds.
OL,8,FSettling down for Wednesday, with
OL,9,Fspells of sunshine and temperatures
OL,10,Faround the seasonal average.
